      "description": "Employment Opportunities | Human Resources | Southern Arkansas University Skip to main content Quick Links Calendar Directory mySAU Email: Student | Faculty Blackboard Course Schedule Library Give Tour Apply About Administration Accreditations Continuous Quality Improvement Consumer Information Financial Services Institutional Research Student Complaint Form Human Resources Mission and Vision Mulerider Mascot News Campus Map Faculty/Staff Resources Center for Excellence in Teaching & Learning Online Learning Physical Plant Request Staff Email Admissions Undergraduate Admissions Concurrent Enrollment Graduate Admissions International Admissions Tuition and Fees Cost Calculator Scholarships Financial Aid Orientation (BAM) Academics Colleges & Departments Business Education & Human Performance Liberal & Performing Arts Science & Engineering Honors Graduate Studies Majors and Degrees General Education Professional License Disclosure Academic Calendar Catalogs Resources Academic Advising Bookstore Magale Library Registrar Student Support Services Writing Center Online Learning Blackboard mySAU Course Schedules LiveText Student Email Final Exam Schedule Campus Life Students Club Sports Greek Life Let’s Talk Webcast Student Conduct Student Handbook Track the Ride Housing Application Costs Amenities Housing Options What to Bring Facilities Bookstore Campus Dining Campus Map Mulerider Activity Center Reynolds Center Story Arena Facilities Rental Physical Plant Request Mulerider Express Career Services Counseling Center University Health Services Athletics Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Office of Development Foundation The Stater Magazine A-Z Index Calendar Give Directory Apply Now Office of Human Resources About New Hires New Employee Orientation Policies Jobs Adminstrative Positions Faculty Positions Staff Positions Part-time Forms Whole Health Holiday Schedule Summer Staff Schedule Staff Awards Spirit of SAU Awards Valuing People Awards Whitehead Staff Excellence Awards Contact You are here: Home / Employment Opportunities Employment Opportunities The Office of Human Resources at Southern Arkansas University lists all open positions available at the University. Full postings for these positions can be found at the Human Resources office and on our web page. Administrative Positions | Faculty Positions | Staff Positions | Part-Time Positions How to Apply Full-time Faculty and Staff Positions Online employment application Applicants apply through the Office of Human Resources. Refer to job advertisement or position announcement for specific application requirements. Part-time/Temporary Positions Applicants apply through the Office of Human Resources. Refer to job advertisement or position announcement on Part-time/Temporary open position web page for specific application requirements. Graduate Assistant Positions Applicants apply through the School of Graduate Studies . Student Employment All students interested in on-campus employment must first contact the Office of Financial Aid to determine eligibility. If eligible, students can contact the Student Employment Office for more information. Applications are accepted by the Office of Human Resources for all open advertised positions. Questions or comments? Please contact the SAU Office of Human Resources by email ( HR Staff ) or call (870) 235-4008. Apply Online Contact Us Office of Human Resources 100 E. University OVR 115 Magnolia, AR 71753 Office (870) 235-4008 Fax (870) 235-5050 Staff Tammy  Sims Tammy  Sims Human Resources Manager Roger Giles Roger Giles Vice President for Administration & General Counsel Micah Williams Micah Williams Administrative Support Specialist Jennifer Richardson Jennifer Richardson Administrative Specialist III Important Links Fringe Benefits Brochure Payroll & Employee Benefits Health Insurance Plan Document Health Insurance Summary of Benefits and Coverage ABCBS - Machine-Readable Files SAU Tech Employment Opportunities Social