ead Staff Excellence Awards Contact You are here: Home / Archives for Employment Opportunities / Faculty Positions Instructor of Agriculture Southern Arkansas University’s College of Science and Engineering is accepting applications for an Instructor of Agriculture position. The successful candidate will teach introductory-level plant science courses and labs, as well as related courses in plant science such as greenhouse management. Additional teaching responsibilities may include courses in the candidate’s area of expertise. Southern Arkansas University… Read More Posted: June 24, 2026 Assistant Professor of Human Performance & Sports Sciences – Exercise Science (Strength & Conditioning) Southern Arkansas University is accepting applications for a 9-month Assistant or Associate Professor, tenure-track position in Exercise Science with an emphasis in Strength & Conditioning. The start date for this position is August 1, 2026. The Department of Human Performance and Sport Sciences, one of the largest at Southern Arkansas University, offers undergraduate degrees in… Read More Posted: May 5, 2026 Apply Online Contact Us Office of Human Resources 100 E. University OVR 115 Magnolia, AR 71753 Office (870) 235-4008 Fax (870) 235-5050 Staff Tammy  Sims Tammy  Sims Human Resources Manager Roger Giles Roger Giles Vice President for Administration & General Counsel Micah Williams Micah Williams Administrative Support Specialist Jennifer Richardson Jennifer Richardson Administrative Specialist III Important Links Fringe Benefits Brochure Payroll & Employee Benefits Health Insurance Plan Document Health Insurance Summary of Benefits and Coverage ABCBS - Machine-Readable Files SAU Tech Employment Opportunities Social Security Administration Student Employment Office Schools & Colleges Business Education & Human Performance Liberal & Performing Arts Science & Engineering Honors College Graduate Studies Quick Links Scholarships & Financial Aid Jobs @ SAU Course Schedules Transcrip