      "description": "Category: Staff Positions | Human Resources | Southern Arkansas University Skip to main content Quick Links Calendar Directory mySAU Email: Student | Faculty Blackboard Course Schedule Library Give Tour Apply About Administration Accreditations Continuous Quality Improvement Consumer Information Financial Services Institutional Research Student Complaint Form Human Resources Mission and Vision Mulerider Mascot News Campus Map Faculty/Staff Resources Center for Excellence in Teaching & Learning Online Learning Physical Plant Request Staff Email Admissions Undergraduate Admissions Concurrent Enrollment Graduate Admissions International Admissions Tuition and Fees Cost Calculator Scholarships Financial Aid Orientation (BAM) Academics Colleges & Departments Business Education & Human Performance Liberal & Performing Arts Science & Engineering Honors Graduate Studies Majors and Degrees General Education Professional License Disclosure Academic Calendar Catalogs Resources Academic Advising Bookstore Magale Library Registrar Student Support Services Writing Center Online Learning Blackboard mySAU Course Schedules LiveText Student Email Final Exam Schedule Campus Life Students Club Sports Greek Life Let’s Talk Webcast Student Conduct Student Handbook Track the Ride Housing Application Costs Amenities Housing Options What to Bring Facilities Bookstore Campus Dining Campus Map Mulerider Activity Center Reynolds Center Story Arena Facilities Rental Physical Plant Request Mulerider Express Career Services Counseling Center University Health Services Athletics Alumni & Friends Alumni Association Office of Development Foundation The Stater Magazine A-Z Index Calendar Give Directory Apply Now Office of Human Resources About New Hires New Employee Orientation Policies Jobs Adminstrative Positions Faculty Positions Staff Positions Part-time Forms Whole Health Holiday Schedule Summer Staff Schedule Staff Awards Spirit of SAU Awards Valuing People Awards Whitehead Staff Excellence Awards Contact You are here: Home / Archives for Employment Opportunities / Staff Positions Accounting and Collections Manager – Student Accounts This position supports the financial operations of the university by managing and monitoring accounts receivable activities, including system billing, collections, student refunds, reconciliations, reporting, and data analysis. The position works closely with university departments to research and resolve outstanding items, maintain accurate financial records, and ensure compliance. The successful candidate must be highly detail-oriented, analytical,… Read More Posted: August 17, 2026 Assistant Director of Development – Annual Gifts The SAU division of Advancement seeks a dynamic and results-oriented individual to join the team as the Assistant Director of Development – Annual Giving. This position plays a pivotal role in driving the success of institutional fundraising efforts by implementing strategies to recruit, retain, and grow donors. The Assistant Director will work closely with the… Read More Posted: August 17, 2026 Admissions Counselor/Recruiter Duties: Coordinate and conduct field visitation for student recruitment; participate in campus visitation and programs, front office duties, reporting, follow up, meeting with and touring prospective students and families; advise and give presentations to high school students and other audiences; provide information to school officials concerning educational opportunities offered at SAU, and other duties assigned…. Read More Posted: August 4, 2026 Arkansas Small Business & Technology Development Center (ASBTDC) Regional Office Business Consultant The Business Consultant provides confidential one-on-one consulting services and training for entrepreneurs and small business owners to support business startup, growth, and sustainability. Consultants assist clients with business planning, financial analysis, marketing strategies, market research, and preparation for capital acquisition. This is a full-time, grant-funded position. Duties: Client Consulting and Technical Assistant: provide confidential, individualized… Read More Posted: September 2, 2026 Tutor Coordinator for Academic Enrichment Center Duties: Supervise day-to-day operations of the tutoring program; recruit, interview, hire, supervise, and evaluate peer and professional tutors; conduct group tutorials when feasible and/or desirable; develop services online, if necessary; oversee online tutoring program (NetTutor); develop learning outcomes and assessment measures for tutoring program and tutor training; conduct student satisfaction surveys regarding tutoring services and… Read More Posted: July 16, 2026 Student Engagement Coordinator Duties: Plan, organize, and execute comprehensive student activities to foster a vibrant campus community; co-advise the Student Activities Board, manage student staff, and utilize engagement data (Give Pulse) to support the university retention and student development goals; organize major campus traditions and events, including Leadership Academy, Organization Fair, and Mulerider Roundup; hire, train, supervise, and… Read More Posted: July 14, 2026 Student Accounts Counselor Duties: analyze student accounts; address student and parent questions and concerns with a high level of customer service; assist in the research and reconciliation of various accounts; input/maintain accurate records; review, evaluate, and analyze financial data regarding student accounts; counsel students, parents, and staff regarding tuition and fees, account balances, scholarships, waivers, payments, payment plans,… Read More Posted: July 7, 2026 Education Specialist Duties: Responsible for identifying, recruiting, selecting, enrolling and providing comprehensive academic, career, and postsecondary services to eligible Talent Search participants; report to the Talent Search Project Director; work with assigned school counselors and community leaders to coordinate tutoring, course advisement, financial aid, college enrollment, career workshops, and education and career enrichment activities; assist with recruitment… Read More Posted: May 6, 2026 Associate or Dean of Enrollment Services Southern Arkansas University is accepting applications for Associate or Dean of Enrollment Services, depending on experience. This position provides creative and energetic leadership for enrollment initiatives in alignment with institutional goals. The position supports the Associate Vice President for Enrollment Services through operational administration and participation in recruitment and admissions. The selected candidate will work… Read More Posted: January 7, 2026 University Videographer Southern Arkansas University seeks a creative and highly skilled University Videographer to join its Communications and Marketing team. The Videographer will plan, produce, and deliver professional video content that supports recruitment, academic initiatives, advancement/foundation efforts, athletics, and a wide range of campus initiatives. This position plays a key role in telling the University’s story to… Read More Posted: October 14, 2025 Assistant Farm Director Duties: operate, maintain, and repair farm tractors and all related equipment; plant, cultivate, and harvest crops, primarily hay; maintain and keep farm buildings and equipment clean; repair farm equipment and buildings; preform all tasks relating to maintaining and improving the SAU cattle herd from AI through final sale or inclusion in the herd (feeding, improving… Read More Posted: June 25, 2025 Physical Plant Extra Help Southern Arkansas University is accepting applications for grounds, carpenters, electricians, or painters. Duties: perform grounds and maintenance work such as trimming, weeding, mowing, event set-up and other duties as assigned; perform general carpentry, general HVAC, electrical, or painting duties. Qualifications: knowledge of lawn care equipment required; small engine maintenance preferred; working knowledge of carpentry and… Read More Posted: February 20, 2025 Apply Online Contact Us Office of Human Resources 100 E. University OVR 115 Magnolia, AR 71753 Office (870) 235-4008 Fax (870) 235-5050 Staff Tammy  Sims Tammy  Sims Human Resources Manager Roger Giles Roger Giles Vice President for Administration & General Counsel Micah Williams Micah Williams Administrative Support Specialist Jennifer Richardson Jennifer Richardson Administrative Specialist III Important Links Fringe Benefits Brochure Payroll & Employee Benefits Health Insurance Plan Document Health Insurance Summary of Benefits and Coverage ABCBS - Machine-Readable Files SAU Tech Employment Opportunities Social Security Administration Student Employment Office Schools & Colleges Business Education & Human Performance Liberal & Performing Arts Science & Engineering Honors College Graduate Studies Quick Links Scholarships & Financial Aid Jobs @ SAU Course Schedules Transcript Request Beyond the Campus Store Bookstore Transferring to SAU Finals Schedule Title IX Campus Emergency Alerts Social Calendar of Events Make a Gift Photos.SAUmag.edu Apply Now Southern Arkansas University is accredited by The Higher Learning Commission . All Rights Reserved. 100 E. University , Magnolia , Arkansas 71753-5000 Telephone: (870) 235-4000 Online Privacy"
